---
---
<section class="bg-[#1B2A4A] py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-14 reveal">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#50A8FF] uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block">
        <span class="en">The Problem</span>
        <span class="ru">Проблема</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">
        <span class="en">Why Traditional OCR No Longer Keeps Up</span>
        <span class="ru">Почему традиционный OCR больше не справляется</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0067B8]/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#50A8FF]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126zM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">
          <span class="en">Helpless Against Complex Fonts</span>
          <span class="ru">Бессилие перед сложными шрифтами</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <span class="en">Conventional recognition systems are powerless against cursive writing, Gothic typefaces, and faded ink.</span>
          <span class="ru">Обычные системы распознавания бессильны перед курсивом, готическими шрифтами и выцветшими чернилами.</span>
        </p>
        <!-- Divider accent -->
        <div class="mt-6 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0067B8] to-transparent rounded-full"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0067B8]/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#50A8FF]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">
          <span class="en">Massive Labor Requirements</span>
          <span class="ru">Колоссальные трудозатраты</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <span class="en">Deciphering complex documents requires thousands of human hours or long-term training of neural networks for a specific handwriting style.</span>
          <span class="ru">Расшифровка сложных документов требует тысяч человеко-часов или долгого обучения нейросетей под конкретный почерк.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0067B8] to-transparent rounded-full"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0067B8]/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#50A8FF]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818l.879.659c1.171.879 3.07.879 4.242 0 1.172-.879 1.172-2.303 0-3.182C13.536 12.219 12.768 12 12 12c-.725 0-1.45-.22-2.003-.659-1.106-.879-1.106-2.303 0-3.182s2.9-.879 4.006 0l.415.33M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">
          <span class="en">Economic Inefficiency</span>
          <span class="ru">Экономическая неэффективность</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <span class="en">Low accuracy makes industrial-scale digitization economically inefficient. Costs remain prohibitively high for large archives.</span>
          <span class="ru">Низкая точность делает промышленную оцифровку экономически неэффективной. Затраты остаются непомерно высокими для крупных архивов.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0067B8] to-transparent rounded-full"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
